    home_title: 'Fabro — Lift off, locally.',
    home_desc: 'Fabro runs powerful AI models on your own computer. Chat, agent, code and voice — private, fast, free.',
    hero_kicker: 'Local AI for everyone',
    hero_title: 'Lift off,<br>locally.',
    hero_sub: 'Fabro runs AI models on your own computer. Chat, research, write, code and talk — your conversations never leave your machine.',
    hero_cta2: 'Can my PC run it?',
    pillar1_h: 'Private by design', pillar1_p: 'Models run on your hardware. No account, no cloud, no tracking.',
    pillar2_h: 'Tuned for your PC', pillar2_p: 'Fabro detects your graphics card and memory, then picks the engine and the model that fit.',
    pillar3_h: 'Simple from the first minute', pillar3_p: 'Install, choose a model, ask. No terminal, no settings to learn.',
    pillar4_h: 'Open models', pillar4_p: 'Gemma, Qwen, gpt-oss and thousands more from Hugging Face — or your own Ollama and online providers.',
