    home_privacy_h: 'Your data stays home', home_privacy_p: 'Fabro only goes online to download what you ask for — models, updates, web pages when you search. Everything else stays on your disk.',
    home_privacy_cta: 'Read how it works',
    home_end_h: 'Ready for take-off?', home_end_p: 'Free, no account. Your first model downloads during installation.',
    // ── feature pages ──
    chat_title: 'Chat — Fabro', chat_kicker: 'Chat', chat_h1: 'A conversation that<br>makes things.',
    chat_lead: 'Ask anything. Fabro answers with formatted text, code, tables — and creates documents, slides and web pages you can open, edit and export.',
    chat_b1_h: 'Documents and slides, not just text', chat_b1_p: 'Ask for a letter, a report or a deck: it opens beside the chat, ready to edit and export to Word, PDF or PowerPoint.',
    chat_b2_h: 'Web search, privately', chat_b2_p: 'When an answer needs fresh facts, Fabro searches the web through its own private search engine, reads the pages and cites its sources.',
    chat_b3_h: 'Think before answering', chat_b3_p: 'Reasoning models show how they got there. Turn thinking on for hard questions, off for quick ones.',
    chat_b4_h: 'The right model, set up for you', chat_b4_p: 'Fabro sizes the context and the memory for your computer. Switch models in one click, or connect Ollama, LM Studio and online providers.',
    agent_title: 'Agent — Fabro', agent_kicker: 'Agent', agent_h1: 'Give it the task,<br>not the steps.',
    agent_lead: 'In agent mode, Fabro plans, uses tools and checks its own work until the job is done — and shows you every step.',
    agent_b1_h: 'Plans and sub-agents', agent_b1_p: 'Big tasks are split into steps. Fabro can hand parts to sub-agents working in parallel, then writes the synthesis. The session panel shows progress, outputs and tools used.',
    agent_b2_h: 'A browser built for AI', agent_b2_p: 'Fabro opens pages, reads them, fills forms and clicks through — in a browser you can watch and take over. Cookie banners and ads are dismissed for it.',
    agent_b3_h: 'Your files, with your permission', agent_b3_p: 'It reads and writes documents, spreadsheets and PDFs, runs Python and commands — and asks before anything sensitive. You choose what it may do on its own.',
    agent_b4_h: 'Honest by default', agent_b4_p: 'Fabro\'s agent prompts push any model to act, check its results and say plainly when something did not work — instead of pretending.',
    code_title: 'Code — Fabro', code_kicker: 'Code', code_h1: 'Your project,<br>your machine, your AI.',
    code_lead: 'Open a folder and describe the change. Fabro reads the code, edits the files, runs your tests and shows you exactly what changed.',
    code_b1_h: 'Edits you can review', code_b1_p: 'Every change appears as a diff. Undo a whole turn in one click — Fabro keeps checkpoints of the files it touches.',
    code_b2_h: 'Tests, terminal, problems', code_b2_p: 'Fabro runs your tests and linters and reads the results. The terminal and problems panels are right there, like in your editor.',
    code_b3_h: 'Git built in', code_b3_p: 'Branches, history, commits and diffs without leaving the app. Fabro can write the commit message for you.',
    code_b4_h: 'Permission modes per project', code_b4_p: 'Ask before every edit, accept edits automatically, or let it run freely in a project you trust.',
    voice_title: 'Voice — Fabro', voice_kicker: 'Voice', voice_h1: 'Just talk.',
    voice_lead: 'Voice mode turns Fabro into a conversation partner. It listens, answers out loud and shows what it explains on a scene — all on your computer.',
    voice_b1_h: 'Speech recognition on your PC', voice_b1_p: 'Whisper models transcribe what you say locally, in many languages. Nothing is sent to a speech service.',
    voice_b2_h: 'Natural voices', voice_b2_p: 'Piper voices read answers sentence by sentence, so Fabro starts speaking right away. Interrupt it any time by talking.',
    voice_b3_h: 'It shows as it tells', voice_b3_p: 'Fabro can draw a diagram, show an image or a key figure on the scene while it speaks.',
    voice_b4_h: 'Dictation everywhere', voice_b4_p: 'Hold the microphone button to dictate into any message box.',
    any_title: 'Anywhere — Fabro', any_kicker: 'Fabro Anywhere', any_h1: 'Fabro, wherever<br>you are.',
    any_lead: 'Ask Fabro from any app on your computer — or from your phone, wherever you are. Your phone talks to your own computer, end-to-end encrypted.',
    any_b1_h: 'Quick ask, from any app', any_b1_p: 'Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Win</kbd> + <kbd>Space</kbd> (or the Copilot key) anywhere: a small Fabro bar appears over what you are doing. The answer continues your conversation in the app.',
    any_b2_h: 'Open in Fabro', any_b2_p: 'Want to go further? One click opens the conversation in the full app, with everything it created.',
    any_b3_h: 'On your phone, paired in a second', any_b3_p: 'Install the Fabro Anywhere web app, point the camera at the circular code your computer shows, done. No account, no password: the code carries your computer’s key.',
